  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/284) by Gal Szkolnik (Bitbucket: [Lockszmith](https://bitbucket.org/Lockszmith), GitHub: [Lockszmith](https://github.com/Lockszmith)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nRawTherapee is available via `winget` in Windows. Which makes installation such an easy process to automate.\n\nThe way it works is by pushing a [PR](https://github.com/microsoft/winget-pkgs/pulls?q=is%3Apr+rawtherapee+is%3Aclosed). The [latest code](https://github.com/microsoft/winget-pkgs/tree/HEAD/manifests/r/RawTherapee/RawTherapee) for RawTherapee can probably be modified easily to create an entry for Art.\n\nSearching for winget over here, I couldn’t find it in the discussions or issues, so decided to post a request for this.\n",
